      "role": "user",
      "content": "transition? thats a nice way to put it. but there is no rebuilding from this. the reputation is scorched. when people look at me now, they dont see a person in transition, they see a joke. a cautionary tale. there is no version of my life where i get that back. i'm just tired of pretending i'm still in the game when the game is clearly over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
